{"id":"3a48adc4ce82ceed","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-krein-milman.md","title":"Krein–Milman Representation Property","display":"df-krein-milman — Krein–Milman Representation Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-krein-milman","aliases":["58-df-krein-milman"],"display":"df-krein-milman — Krein–Milman Representation Property","depends_on":["[[58-df-convex]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-krein-milman"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-krein-milman</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-krein-milman — Krein–Milman Representation Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d57fb1b329c235bc\" href=\"?note=d57fb1b329c235bc\" title=\"58-df-convex\">58-df-convex</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,+_E,\\odot,\\tau,K,A\\in V\">\\(E,+_E,\\odot,\\tau,K,A\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,A\\subseteq E\">\\(K,A\\subseteq E\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(E,+_E,\\odot)\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(E,+_E,\\odot)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Convex}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Convex}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d57fb1b329c235bc\" href=\"?note=d57fb1b329c235bc\" title=\"58-df-convex\">58-df-convex</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(E,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(E,\\tau)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExtPts},\\operatorname{ConvHull},\\operatorname{Cl}\">\\(\\operatorname{ExtPts},\\operatorname{ConvHull},\\operatorname{Cl}\\)</span> are the set-valued terms defined below</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KreinMilmanRepresentation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{KreinMilmanRepresentation}_S\\)</span> is the five-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman\\text{-}extreme\\text{-}points}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ExtPts}(K,E,+_E,\\odot)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{x\\in K:\\forall y,z\\in K\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(0&lt;t&lt;1\\land x=+_E\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\\odot(\\langle1-t,y\\rangle),\\odot(\\langle t,z\\rangle)\\right\\rangle\\right)\\to y=z\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman\\text{-}extreme\\text{-}points}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ExtPts}(K,E,+_E,\\odot)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{x\\in K:\\forall y,z\\in K\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(0&lt;t&lt;1\\land x=+_E\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\\odot(\\langle1-t,y\\rangle),\\odot(\\langle t,z\\rangle)\\right\\rangle\\right)\\to y=z\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman\\text{-}convex\\text{-}hull}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ConvHull}(A,E,+_E,\\odot)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{C\\subseteq E:A\\subseteq C\\land\\mathrm{Convex}_S(C,E,+_E,\\odot)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman\\text{-}convex\\text{-}hull}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ConvHull}(A,E,+_E,\\odot)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{C\\subseteq E:A\\subseteq C\\land\\mathrm{Convex}_S(C,E,+_E,\\odot)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Cl}_{E,\\tau}(A)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{F\\subseteq E:A\\subseteq F\\land E\\setminus F\\in\\tau\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Cl}_{E,\\tau}(A)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{F\\subseteq E:A\\subseteq F\\land E\\setminus F\\in\\tau\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman} \\vdash \\mathrm{KreinMilmanRepresentation}_S(K,E,+_E,\\odot,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(E,\\tau)\\land\\emptyset\\neq K\\subseteq E\\land\\mathrm{Convex}_S(K,E,+_E,\\odot)\\land K=\\operatorname{Cl}_{E,\\tau}\\!\\left(\\operatorname{ConvHull}(\\operatorname{ExtPts}(K,E,+_E,\\odot),E,+_E,\\odot)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman} \\vdash \\mathrm{KreinMilmanRepresentation}_S(K,E,+_E,\\odot,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(E,\\tau)\\land\\emptyset\\neq K\\subseteq E\\land\\mathrm{Convex}_S(K,E,+_E,\\odot)\\land K=\\operatorname{Cl}_{E,\\tau}\\!\\left(\\operatorname{ConvHull}(\\operatorname{ExtPts}(K,E,+_E,\\odot),E,+_E,\\odot)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Krein–Milman theorem states that every nonempty compact convex subset of a locally convex Hausdorff topological vector space has this representation property.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-convex","status":"resolved","id":"d57fb1b329c235bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-convex]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-convex","status":"resolved","id":"d57fb1b329c235bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(E,+_E,\\odot)$ and $\\mathrm{Convex}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[58-df-convex]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(E,\\tau)$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,+_E,\\odot,\\tau,K,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"K,A\\subseteq E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(E,+_E,\\odot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Convex}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(E,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExtPts},\\operatorname{ConvHull},\\operatorname{Cl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KreinMilmanRepresentation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman\\text{-}extreme\\text{-}points}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ExtPts}(K,E,+_E,\\odot)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{x\\in K:\\forall y,z\\in K\\;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(0<t<1\\land x=+_E\\!\\left(\\left\\langle\\odot(\\langle1-t,y\\rangle),\\odot(\\langle t,z\\rangle)\\right\\rangle\\right)\\to y=z\\right)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman\\text{-}convex\\text{-}hull}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ConvHull}(A,E,+_E,\\odot)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{C\\subseteq E:A\\subseteq C\\land\\mathrm{Convex}_S(C,E,+_E,\\odot)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Cl}_{E,\\tau}(A)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{F\\subseteq E:A\\subseteq F\\land E\\setminus F\\in\\tau\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}krein\\text{-}milman} \\vdash \\mathrm{KreinMilmanRepresentation}_S(K,E,+_E,\\odot,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(E,\\tau)\\land\\emptyset\\neq K\\subseteq E\\land\\mathrm{Convex}_S(K,E,+_E,\\odot)\\land K=\\operatorname{Cl}_{E,\\tau}\\!\\left(\\operatorname{ConvHull}(\\operatorname{ExtPts}(K,E,+_E,\\odot),E,+_E,\\odot)\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":2065,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-744","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-krein-milman.md|58-df-krein-milman]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["d57fb1b329c235bc","815e63e5071e7b58"]}